[13.3502, "o", "\u001b[90m\u2502\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25c6\u001b[39m  Robo Guardians activated \u2014 they can now join keygen and signing. Confirm any time via \"Check robo guardians\".\r\n"]
